  "prefLabel": "Ins 4104.02 Applicability and Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 4104.02 Applicability and Scope. This part shall apply to every large employer health insurance policy, rider, or endorsement form affecting health coverage as that term is defined by RSA 420-G:2, IX.\n\nSource. #9690, eff 4-9-10; ss by #9938, eff 6-10-11; ss by #12799, eff 6-10-19",
